      "maxArea": {"title":"最大面积","type":"number","minimum":0,"default":0,"xVisibleWhen":{"collectionType":["blobs","contours","measurements"],"areaEnabled":[true]},"xValidateWhen":{"collectionType":["","blobs","contours","measurements"],"areaEnabled":[true]}},
